I HAVE A NICE BODY
AND I WANNA SHOW IT OFF!

00:11:02.891 --> 00:11:04.224
YOU GOT THAT?

00:11:04.226 --> 00:11:06.025
YOU'VE GOT TO WEIGH
90 POUNDS.

00:11:06.027 --> 00:11:09.095
I'M UP TO 94,
THANK YOU VERY MUCH.

00:11:09.097 --> 00:11:09.662
( mumbling )

00:11:09.664 --> 00:11:13.433
YEAH THEY'RE ALMOST
AS BIG AS HIS MOMS!

00:11:13.969 --> 00:11:14.868
LAUGH ALL YOU WANT!

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:17.904
I'M THE ONE WHO'S GONNA
BE ON TV LOOKING ALL BUFF.

00:11:17.906 --> 00:11:19.372
WHAT'S THAT STUFF?

00:11:19.374 --> 00:11:20.874
<i>WEIGHT GAIN 4,000.</i>

00:11:20.876 --> 00:11:22.509
IT'S HELPING ME
BULK UP.

00:11:22.511 --> 00:11:24.310
BULK UP TO WHAT?
FAT ASS?

00:11:24.312 --> 00:11:24.978
SUPER FAT ASS?

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:27.647
HEY, I DON'T HAVE TO
TAKE THAT KIND OF CRAP

00:11:27.649 --> 00:11:30.783
FROM YOU SCRAWNY
WEAKLINGS!

00:11:32.754 --> 00:11:34.153
SWEET,
CHECK ME OUT.

00:11:34.155 --> 00:11:37.590
I'M SUCH A BEEFCAKE I CAN'T EVEN
GET THROUGH THE DOOR.

00:11:37.592 --> 00:11:40.927
C'MON PEOPLE, WE'VE GOT
TO TURN THIS PLACE AROUND!

00:11:40.929 --> 00:11:43.696
HANG UP THE LIGHTS,
STRING UP UP THE BANNERS,

00:11:43.698 --> 00:11:46.366
CASTRATE THE COWS!

00:11:47.202 --> 00:11:48.935
WELL MR. GARRISON,

00:11:48.937 --> 00:11:51.704
HOW IS THE
LITTLE PLAY GOING?

00:11:51.706 --> 00:11:52.338
OH, FINE.

00:11:52.340 --> 00:11:54.674
WE WERE JUST ABOUT
TO RUN IT FROM THE TOP.

00:11:54.676 --> 00:11:55.942
OH, PLEASE DO.

00:11:55.944 --> 00:11:57.277
I'M<i> DYING</i>
TO SEE IT.

00:11:57.279 --> 00:12:01.147
ALL THE LITTLE PIONEERS
ON THIS SIDE OF THE STAGE.

00:12:01.149 --> 00:12:01.648
GOOD.

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:05.018
AND ALL THE LITTLE INDIANS
GO TO THE CENTER OF THE STAGE.

00:12:05.020 --> 00:12:07.287
AM I AN INDIAN
OR A PIONEER?

00:12:07.289 --> 00:12:09.355
DO YOU HAVE A FEATHER
ON YOUR HEAD?

00:12:09.357 --> 00:12:09.822
YES.

00:12:09.824 --> 00:12:11.324
THEN YOU'RE
AN INDIAN.

00:12:11.326 --> 00:12:11.858
OH.

00:12:11.860 --> 00:12:13.893
OKAY, BABAY,
THIS IS YOUR LINE.

00:12:13.895 --> 00:12:17.297
THIS IS THE STORY
OF SOUTH PARK.

00:12:17.299 --> 00:12:20.366
IT BEGINS OVER
A HUNDRED YEARS AGO

00:12:20.368 --> 00:12:23.870
WHEN THE NOBLE AND HEARTY
UTE INDIANS

00:12:23.872 --> 00:12:26.372
LIVED ON THE LAND.

00:12:28.677 --> 00:12:31.578
OH, DON'T THEY
LOOK ADORABLE?

00:12:31.580 --> 00:12:33.279
THEN FROM THE EAST

00:12:33.281 --> 00:12:36.316
CAME THE GREAT
WHITE PIONEERS.

00:12:36.851 --> 00:12:38.451
( screaming )

00:12:41.389 --> 00:12:42.322
OH, MY GOD!

00:12:42.324 --> 00:12:44.424
THEY DID IT A LOT BETTER
THIS MORNING.

00:12:44.426 --> 00:12:45.959
THEY HAD
MORE ENERGY.

00:12:45.961 --> 00:12:48.328
THE PIONEERS MET
WITH THE INDIANS

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:53.032
AND NEGOTIATED
FOR THEIR FERTILE LANDS.

00:12:53.435 --> 00:12:54.000
MR. GARRISON,

00:12:54.002 --> 00:12:56.869
WE CANNOT HAVE OUR CHILDREN
BEATING EACH OTHER SENSELESS

00:12:56.871 --> 00:12:58.605
IN FRONT OF
KATHIE LEE GIFFORD!

00:12:58.607 --> 00:12:59.772
WELL WHAT
DO YOU WANT?

00:12:59.774 --> 00:13:01.908
THIS IS HOW IT HAPPENED
IN THOSE DAYS.

00:13:01.910 --> 00:13:04.110
TAKE THAT,
YOU STUPID INDIAN!

00:13:04.112 --> 00:13:07.614
MR. GARRISON,
THIS IS NOT APPROPRIATE!

00:13:07.616 --> 00:13:09.082
DO YOU
ACTUALLY THINK

00:13:09.084 --> 00:13:11.684
THAT KATHIE LEE GIFFORD
WOULD ENJOY THIS?!

00:13:11.686 --> 00:13:14.153
TO HELL WITH
KATHIE LEE GIFFORD!

00:13:14.155 --> 00:13:16.089
( crowd gasping )

00:13:16.091 --> 00:13:18.124
OH, MY GOD,
WHAT HAVE I SAID?

00:13:18.126 --> 00:13:21.561
HE SAID "TO HELL WITH
KATHIE LEE GIFFORD"!

00:13:21.563 --> 00:13:22.495
<i>MR. GARRISON,</i>

00:13:22.497 --> 00:13:26.933
I AM DISMISSING YOU
FROM DIRECTING OUR PLAY.

00:13:28.937 --> 00:13:31.304
IT HAPPENED AGAIN,
DIDN'T IT?

00:13:31.306 --> 00:13:33.906
NOW WE DO THINGS
<i>MY</i> WAY.

00:13:33.908 --> 00:13:35.975
I CAN'T KILL HER,
MR. HAT.

00:13:35.977 --> 00:13:39.646
<i>YOU'RE</i> GONNA
HAVE TO DO IT.

00:13:39.648 --> 00:13:41.648
( evil laugh )

00:13:44.919 --> 00:13:47.420
WHOA, CARTMAN,
TALK ABOUT WIDE LOAD.

00:13:47.422 --> 00:13:50.423
YEAH, I'M REALLY STARTING
TO FILL OUT NICELY.

00:13:50.425 --> 00:13:52.492
YOU'RE NOT
FILLING OUT NICELY!

00:13:52.494 --> 00:13:54.093
YOU'RE FATTER
THAN EVER!

00:13:54.095 --> 00:13:56.462
I'M NOT FAT,
I'M GETTING IN SHAPE!

00:13:56.464 --> 00:13:57.864
CARTMAN, YOU'RE SUCH
A FAT ASS

00:13:57.866 --> 00:14:00.099
THEN WHEN YOU WALK DOWN
THE STREET PEOPLE GO,

00:14:00.101 --> 00:14:02.402
"GODDAMNIT,
THAT'S A BIG FAT ASS!"

00:14:02.404 --> 00:14:04.937
NO THEY DON'T,
YOU JEALOUS WEAKLING!

00:14:04.939 --> 00:14:07.974
GODDAMN,
THAT'S A BIG FAT ASS!

00:14:07.976 --> 00:14:09.308
HEY!

00:14:09.310 --> 00:14:09.876
HI GUYS.

00:14:09.878 --> 00:14:11.744
OH, LOOK,
ANOTHER HIPPY.

00:14:11.746 --> 00:14:13.146
PEACE, WENDY.

00:14:13.148 --> 00:14:14.180
SHUT UP,
CARTMAN!

00:14:14.182 --> 00:14:17.650
♪ TWO LITTLE HIPPIES
SITTING IN A TREE ♪

00:14:17.652 --> 00:14:19.585
I'M GONNA FIND
CARTMAN'S PAPER

00:14:19.587 --> 00:14:21.988
AND GET TO
THE BOTTOM OF THIS.

00:14:23.358 --> 00:14:25.391
CAN I HELP YOU?

00:14:25.393 --> 00:14:26.993
YES...
I NEED A GUN.

00:14:26.995 --> 00:14:29.429
WOULD THIS BE FOR HUNTING,
OR PROTECTION,

00:14:29.431 --> 00:14:31.030
OR OTHER?

00:14:31.032 --> 00:14:31.564
OTHER.

00:14:31.566 --> 00:14:32.465
ALRIGHTY THEN,

00:14:32.467 --> 00:14:35.268
MAY I SUGGEST A
STRADFORD 12 MILLIMETER?

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:36.703
TRY IT ON!

00:14:36.705 --> 00:14:38.838
THAT LOOKS
REALLY NICE ON YOU.

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:41.607
THE LACQUER BLACK
REALLY MATCHES YOUR EYES.

00:14:41.609 --> 00:14:42.775
YOU TALKING TO ME?

00:14:42.777 --> 00:14:44.177
ARE YOU TALKING
TO ME?

00:14:44.179 --> 00:14:46.479
I DON'T KNOW,
IT'S A LITTLE SMALL.

00:14:46.481 --> 00:14:49.148
OKAY...
HOW ABOUT THIS?

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:50.817
YOU TALKING TO ME?!

00:14:50.819 --> 00:14:52.185
NO, I DON'T LIKE
THIS ONE EITHER.

00:14:52.187 --> 00:14:55.321
HERE'S THE SAME GUN
WITH A<i> WOOD</i> FINISH.

00:14:55.323 --> 00:14:56.589
YOU TALKING
TO ME?!

00:14:56.591 --> 00:14:58.291
I DON'T SEE ANYBODY ELSE
AROUND HERE.

00:14:58.293 --> 00:15:00.526
SO YOU MUST BE
TALKING TO ME.

00:15:00.528 --> 00:15:02.862
I'LL TAKE IT.

00:15:03.431 --> 00:15:04.731
HELLO?

00:15:20.482 --> 00:15:23.082
"MY ESSAY,
BY ERIC CARTMAN."

00:15:23.084 --> 00:15:25.551
"WHEN I WROTE
THE FOLLOWING PAGES,

00:15:25.553 --> 00:15:27.053
"OR RATHER
THE BULK OF THEM,

00:15:27.055 --> 00:15:31.124
I LIVED ALONE IN THE WOODS
ON THE SHORE OF..."

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:33.960
WELL, MR. HAT,

00:15:33.962 --> 00:15:36.996
I GUESS OLD KATHIE LEE
REALLY WILL BE SURPRISED

00:15:36.998 --> 00:15:38.631
WHEN SHE GETS
HERE TOMORROW.

00:15:38.633 --> 00:15:41.868
SHE BEAT US IN THE TALENT SHOW
ALL THOSE YEARS AGO.

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:44.670
AND I THINK
WE OWE HER FOR THAT.

00:15:44.672 --> 00:15:46.506
BA-BANG!

00:15:46.508 --> 00:15:48.107
OH, MY GOD!

00:15:55.517 --> 00:15:57.650
HOWDY, MR. GARRISON,
NICE GUN.

00:15:57.652 --> 00:15:58.317
THANK YOU.

00:15:58.319 --> 00:16:00.686
NICE GUN,
MR. GARRISON.

00:16:00.688 --> 00:16:01.654
THANKS.

00:16:01.656 --> 00:16:03.790
HELLO OFFICER
BARBRADY.

00:16:03.792 --> 00:16:05.024
NICE GUN.

00:16:05.026 --> 00:16:06.325
IS THERE
SOMEWHERE IN TOWN

00:16:06.327 --> 00:16:08.461
WHERE I CAN GET
A GOOD CLEAR SHOT--

00:16:08.463 --> 00:16:09.495
VIEW OF KATHIE LEE?

00:16:09.497 --> 00:16:12.465
HMM, YOU KNOW
I THINK THE BOOK DEPOSITORY

00:16:12.467 --> 00:16:15.034
WOULD BE A GOOD BET.

00:16:16.805 --> 00:16:18.805
YES, THAT MIGHT
DO QUITE NICELY.

00:16:18.807 --> 00:16:21.707
THANK YOU
OFFICER BARBRADY.

00:16:21.709 --> 00:16:22.875
NO PROBLEM.

00:16:22.877 --> 00:16:24.744
HA! CAUGHT YOU
RED-HANDED!

00:16:24.746 --> 00:16:28.181
NO PICTURES
OF KATHIE LEE!

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:30.983
WHERE IS SHE?

00:16:31.519 --> 00:16:32.819
THIS IS SWEET.

00:16:32.821 --> 00:16:34.420
CAMERA CREWS
ARE SETTING UP.

00:16:34.422 --> 00:16:36.756
AND I'M LOOKING
TOTALLY WHIPPED.

00:16:36.758 --> 00:16:37.690
BEEFCAKE!

00:16:37.692 --> 00:16:38.257
BEEFCAKE!

00:16:38.259 --> 00:16:41.160
I DON'T THINK THEY'RE GONNA
GET ALL OF YOU IN FRAME.

00:16:41.162 --> 00:16:43.462
YOU GUYS,
WE HAVE TO STOP HIM!

00:16:43.464 --> 00:16:44.363
STOP WHO?

00:16:44.365 --> 00:16:45.164
MR. GARRISON!

00:16:45.166 --> 00:16:48.067
HE'S GOING TO TRY TO KILL
KATHIE LEE GIFFORD!

00:16:48.069 --> 00:16:49.135
OH NO
YOU DON'T!

00:16:49.137 --> 00:16:52.205
YOU'RE NOT GONNA RUIN
<i>MY</i> MOMENT OF FAME.

00:16:52.207 --> 00:16:53.005
HE'S GOT A A GUN!

00:16:53.007 --> 00:16:55.641
YOU GOTTA GET OVER
THIS WHOLE JEALOUSY THING.

00:16:55.643 --> 00:16:57.777
SERIOUSLY,
JUST FACE IT.

00:16:57.779 --> 00:17:00.012
I WROTE A BETTER PAPER
THAN<i> YOU.</i>

00:17:00.014 --> 00:17:01.247
IT JUST SO HAPPENS

00:17:01.249 --> 00:17:04.150
THAT I<i> HAVE</i> YOUR PAPER
AND I KNOW<i> WHY</i> YOU WON.

00:17:04.152 --> 00:17:06.953
THERE'S SOMETHING MORE
IMPORTANT RIGHT NOW!

00:17:06.955 --> 00:17:07.720
LET'S GO!

00:17:07.722 --> 00:17:09.622
WENDY, YOU'VE GOT
TO PRIORITIZE.

00:17:09.624 --> 00:17:10.923
WHAT'S MORE
IMPORTANT...

00:17:10.925 --> 00:17:14.293
BEING ON TV OR SOME
STUPID ASSASSINATION?

00:17:14.295 --> 00:17:17.163
STAN, I CAN'T
DO IT ALONE.

00:17:17.165 --> 00:17:18.130
PLEASE?

00:17:18.132 --> 00:17:20.533
( Kyle )
UH-OH, WE'RE LOSING HIM.

00:17:20.535 --> 00:17:22.335
HERE SHE COMES!

00:17:22.337 --> 00:17:24.904
( parade music )

00:17:28.009 --> 00:17:30.810
DAMN, I GUESS I'M NOT
THE ONLY PERSON IN AMERICA

00:17:30.812 --> 00:17:33.913
WHO'S THOUGHT OF KILLING
KATHIE LEE GIFFORD.

00:17:33.915 --> 00:17:36.082
WE LOVE YOU,
KATHIE LEE!

00:17:36.084 --> 00:17:38.384
( muffled )
I LOVE YOU TOO.

00:17:38.386 --> 00:17:40.353
C'MON,
YOU LITTLE BITCH.

00:17:40.355 --> 00:17:42.922
YOU'VE GOT TO COME OUT OF
YOUR PRECIOUS BUBBLE

00:17:42.924 --> 00:17:45.024
SOONER OR LATER,
MISSY.

00:17:45.026 --> 00:17:46.859
IT IS WITH GREAT
PRIDE AND HONOR

00:17:46.861 --> 00:17:50.463
THAT I'D LIKE TO WELCOME
MRS. KATHIE LEE GIFFORD

00:17:50.465 --> 00:17:53.266
TO SOUTH PARK!

00:17:53.268 --> 00:17:54.533
( cheering )

00:17:54.535 --> 00:17:58.371
AND NOW OUR VERY OWN
SOUTH PARK ELEMENTARY CHEF

00:17:58.373 --> 00:18:00.506
WILL SING
A SPECIAL SONG

00:18:00.508 --> 00:18:03.609
IN HONOR OF
MRS. LEE GIFFORD!

00:18:04.145 --> 00:18:05.711
THANK YOU
MR. MAYOR.

00:18:05.713 --> 00:18:09.815
YOU KNOW, KATHIE LEE,
YOU ARE A VERY SPECIAL WOMAN.

00:18:09.817 --> 00:18:12.919
I DON'T MEAN SPECIAL
IN A<i> MARY TYLER MOORE</i> WAY

00:18:12.921 --> 00:18:15.621
OR SPECIAL IN AN
EXTRA VALUE MEAL

00:18:15.623 --> 00:18:17.657
AT "HAPPY BURGER" WAY...

00:18:17.659 --> 00:18:20.526
NO, NO, NO,
I MEAN SPECIAL.

00:18:20.528 --> 00:18:22.662
LIKE THE SONG OF
THE HUMMING BIRD

00:18:22.664 --> 00:18:25.898
AS IT GETS READY TO FIND
THAT FEMALE HUMMING BIRD

00:18:25.900 --> 00:18:29.268
AND MAKE SWEET LOVE TO IT
ALL NIGHT LONG.

00:18:29.270 --> 00:18:33.406
JUST TWO HUMMING BIRDS
MOANING AND GROANING

00:18:33.408 --> 00:18:35.274
AND LETTING
THEIR BODIES CARESS

00:18:35.276 --> 00:18:38.244
AND TOUCH EACH OTHER
IN ECSTASY.

00:18:38.246 --> 00:18:40.146
♪ OH KATHIE LEE ♪

00:18:40.148 --> 00:18:43.783
♪ HOW I LOVE TO LAY
YOU DOWN ♪

00:18:43.785 --> 00:18:47.286
♪ AND LICK EVERY INCH
OF YOUR BODY ♪

00:18:47.288 --> 00:18:48.721
♪ WITH MY TONGUE ♪

00:18:48.723 --> 00:18:49.355
WHAT!?

00:18:49.357 --> 00:18:52.725
♪ KATHIE LEE,
YOU'RE MY SEXUAL FANTASY ♪

00:18:52.727 --> 00:18:53.359
WHAT?!

00:18:53.361 --> 00:18:55.294
♪ HOW ABOUT
YOU AND ME ♪

00:18:55.296 --> 00:18:58.264
THANK YOU, CHEF,
FOR THAT HEART-WARMING SONG.

00:18:58.266 --> 00:19:00.199
♪ MAKE SWEET LOVE ♪

00:19:00.201 --> 00:19:01.667
THANK YOU, CHEF!

00:19:01.669 --> 00:19:02.201
OH.

00:19:02.203 --> 00:19:05.338
GOD BLESS YOU,
KATHIE LEE!

00:19:05.974 --> 00:19:06.672
OFFICER BARBRADY,

00:19:06.674 --> 00:19:09.108
MR. GARRISON IS ABOUT
TO KILL KATHIE LEE!

00:19:09.110 --> 00:19:11.043
WE HAVE TO
FIND HIM!

00:19:11.045 --> 00:19:13.212
WHAT? YOU MEAN
THE TEACHER?

00:19:13.214 --> 00:19:14.680
WAIT A MINUTE...

00:19:14.682 --> 00:19:16.148
IS THERE
SOMEWHERE IN TOWN

00:19:16.150 --> 00:19:18.284
WHERE I CAN GET
A GOOD CLEAR SHOT--

00:19:18.286 --> 00:19:19.719
VIEW OF KATHIE LEE?

00:19:19.721 --> 00:19:23.255
I THINK THE BOOK DEPOSITORY
WOULD BE A GOOD BET.

00:19:23.257 --> 00:19:26.959
I THINK THE BOOK DEPOSITORY
WOULD BE A GOOD BET.

00:19:26.961 --> 00:19:28.327
BOOK DEPOSITORY.

00:19:28.329 --> 00:19:29.395
DEPOSITORY.

00:19:29.397 --> 00:19:30.896
BOOK DEPOSITORY.

00:19:30.898 --> 00:19:32.665
DAMN, HE COULD
BE ANYWHERE!

00:19:32.667 --> 00:19:34.834
I'LL SEND OUT
AN<i> APB.</i>

00:19:34.836 --> 00:19:36.902
WENDY, LOOK!

00:19:36.904 --> 00:19:39.138
AND NOW, HERE TO PRESENT
THE AWARD

00:19:39.140 --> 00:19:43.776
FOR THE ENVIRONMENTAL ESSAY
TO OUR OWN ERIC KAUFMANN--

00:19:43.778 --> 00:19:45.711
( Eric )
CARTMAN, GODDAMNIT!

00:19:45.713 --> 00:19:49.181
IS<i> YOUR</i> FAVORITE CELEBRITY
AND MINE...

00:19:49.183 --> 00:19:53.552
KATHIE LEE GIFFORD!

00:19:56.157 --> 00:19:57.323
THANK YOU.

00:19:57.325 --> 00:19:58.891
I LOVE YOU ALL.

00:19:58.893 --> 00:20:00.192
MR. GARRISON!

00:20:00.194 --> 00:20:00.960
STOP!

00:20:00.962 --> 00:20:01.727
LEAVE US.

00:20:01.729 --> 00:20:04.096
WE MUST FINISH
WHAT WE HAVE BEGUN.

00:20:04.098 --> 00:20:06.532
I KNOW THAT
SHE'S HURT YOU.

00:20:06.534 --> 00:20:07.800
SHE'S HURT
A LOT OF PEOPLE.

00:20:07.802 --> 00:20:09.101
YOU CAN'T KNOW.

00:20:09.103 --> 00:20:11.504
YOU SHOULD'VE WON
THAT TALENT SHOW.

00:20:11.506 --> 00:20:13.506
IT IS WITH GREAT HONOR
AND PRIDE

00:20:13.508 --> 00:20:15.875
THAT I PRESENT THE WINNER
THIS TROPHY.

00:20:15.877 --> 00:20:18.577
ERIC, WOULD YOU PLEASE
COME UP HERE.

00:20:18.579 --> 00:20:19.779
HERE IT IS...

00:20:19.781 --> 00:20:21.647
MY BIG MOMENT OF FAME.

00:20:21.649 --> 00:20:24.517
AND THEN SHE FINISHED IT ALL
BY THROWING HER VOICE

00:20:24.519 --> 00:20:25.684
WITH TWO DUMMIES
AT ONCE.

00:20:25.686 --> 00:20:29.722
I KNOW THAT MR. GARRISON,
BUT THIS ISN'T THE ANSWER.

00:20:29.724 --> 00:20:30.389
IT IS...

00:20:30.391 --> 00:20:33.459
TOO LATE FOR ME,
YOUNG WENDY.

00:20:34.729 --> 00:20:37.163
YOU SEE, I'VE LEARNED
SOMETHING TODAY.

00:20:37.165 --> 00:20:39.365
YOU CAN'T WIN
<i>ALL</i> THE TIME.

00:20:39.367 --> 00:20:40.199
AND IF YOU DON'T WIN,

00:20:40.201 --> 00:20:42.701
YOU CERTAINLY CAN'T HOLD IT
AGAINST THE PERSON WHO DID

00:20:42.703 --> 00:20:47.339
BECAUSE THAT'S THE ONLY WAY
YOU EVER<i> REALLY</i> LOSE.

00:20:47.341 --> 00:20:49.809
YOU'RE RIGHT.

00:20:49.811 --> 00:20:50.342
<i>GOOD.</i>

00:20:50.344 --> 00:20:52.511
MAN, DID SHE REALLY
THROW HER VOICE

00:20:52.513 --> 00:20:54.780
WITH TWO DUMMIES
AT ONCE?

00:20:54.782 --> 00:20:56.982
THE BITCH MUST DIE!

00:21:05.526 --> 00:21:07.793
OH, MY GOD,
THEY KILLED KENNY!

00:21:07.795 --> 00:21:10.429
YOU BASTARD!

00:21:10.565 --> 00:21:11.497
GUARD!

00:21:11.499 --> 00:21:11.964
GUARD!

00:21:11.966 --> 00:21:13.099
HEY COME BACK!

00:21:13.101 --> 00:21:15.801
WE DIDN'T EVEN
GET TO DO OUR PLAY!

00:21:16.671 --> 00:21:18.737
I GUESS THAT'S IT GUYS,
WRAP IT UP.

00:21:18.739 --> 00:21:20.072
HEY WAIT A MINUTE!

00:21:20.074 --> 00:21:22.741
WHEN DO I GET
TO BE ON TELEVISION?!

00:21:22.743 --> 00:21:23.809
FORGET IT, KID.

00:21:23.811 --> 00:21:25.711
NO KATHIE LEE,
NO PUBLIC INTEREST.

00:21:25.713 --> 00:21:28.747
BUT I WON THE
ENVIRONMENTAL ESSAY CONTEST!

00:21:28.749 --> 00:21:31.784
YOU DON'T<i> DESERVE</i>
TO WIN, CARTMAN,

00:21:31.786 --> 00:21:33.018
AND YOU KNOW IT!

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:35.721
I'M HOLDING CARTMAN'S
AWARD-WINNING PAPER.

00:21:35.723 --> 00:21:38.524
IT'S ACTUALLY NOTHING MORE
THAN "WALDEN"

00:21:38.526 --> 00:21:40.726
WITH<i> HENRY DAVID THOREAU'S</i>
NAME CROSSED OUT

00:21:40.728 --> 00:21:43.963
AND CARTMAN'S NAME
WRITTEN IN ITS PLACE.

00:21:43.965 --> 00:21:44.763
WHO CARES?

00:21:44.765 --> 00:21:46.966
KATHIE LEE GIFFORD'S
GONE!

00:21:46.968 --> 00:21:48.734
WHAT ABOUT NOT
HOLDING ANYTHING

00:21:48.736 --> 00:21:50.302
AGAINST THE PERSON
WHO WINS?

00:21:50.304 --> 00:21:53.005
WELL, NOT IF
IT'S CARTMAN.

00:21:53.007 --> 00:21:54.940
HEY, WHERE ARE YOU
ALL GOING?!

00:21:54.942 --> 00:21:57.443
THEY DON'T EVEN KNOW
WHAT "WALDEN"<i> IS.</i>

00:21:57.445 --> 00:22:01.847
I BET IF "WALDEN" WAS A SITCOM
YOU'D ALL KNOW WHAT IT WAS!

00:22:01.849 --> 00:22:02.481
C'MON, WENDY,

00:22:02.483 --> 00:22:05.284
KYLE'S MOM WILL MAKE US
TUNA FISH SANDWICHES.

00:22:05.286 --> 00:22:07.419
OH, WHAT THE HELL.

00:22:07.421 --> 00:22:08.621
NO, NO!

00:22:08.623 --> 00:22:11.790
NOW I'LL BE STUCK
IN THIS TOWN FOREVER

00:22:11.792 --> 00:22:15.594
WITH ALL THESE STUPID HICK
RED-NECK, JOBLESS,

00:22:15.596 --> 00:22:17.730
TRUCK DRIVING IDIOTS!

00:22:17.732 --> 00:22:19.798
MAYOR,
THE MIC IS ON.

00:22:19.800 --> 00:22:23.135
THOUGHT YOU COULD GET AWAY
WITH IT, MR. HAT?

00:22:23.137 --> 00:22:24.870
I WOULD'VE GOTTEN
AWAY WITH IT

00:22:24.872 --> 00:22:26.338
IF IT WEREN'T
FOR THOSE MEDDLING KIDS.

00:22:26.340 --> 00:22:28.541
YOU'RE LUCKY YOU MISSED
KATHIE LEE GIFFORD

00:22:28.543 --> 00:22:31.277
AND THAT
NOBODY GOT HURT.

00:22:35.716 --> 00:22:37.149
WELL CHILDREN,
I'D LOVE TO,

00:22:37.151 --> 00:22:40.419
BUT THE DOCTORS SAY THAT
MR. HAT NEEDS MORE THERAPY.

00:22:40.421 --> 00:22:41.887
WE CAN STILL
GET HER!

00:22:41.889 --> 00:22:45.524
I'M JUST SO SORRY THAT
I RUINED EVERYONE'S CHANCES

00:22:45.526 --> 00:22:46.992
FOR BEING ON TV.

00:22:46.994 --> 00:22:50.095
NOT CARTMAN, HE GETS
TO BE ON TV ANYWAY.

00:22:50.097 --> 00:22:51.997
REALLY?
ON WHAT?

00:22:51.999 --> 00:22:53.165
OBESITY...

00:22:53.167 --> 00:22:54.800
ADIPOSITY...

00:22:54.802 --> 00:22:55.434
CORPULENCE...

00:22:55.436 --> 00:22:59.505
WHATEVER WORD YOU USE,
IT REPRESENTS ONE THING...

00:22:59.507 --> 00:23:00.539
BEING A BIG FAT ASS.

00:23:00.541 --> 00:23:02.775
WE HAVE WITH US TODAY,
LIVE VIA SATELLITE

00:23:02.777 --> 00:23:05.344
ERIC CARTMAN
FROM SOUTH PARK,

00:23:05.346 --> 00:23:07.046
WHO IS NOW SO OBESE

00:23:07.048 --> 00:23:09.682
HE CAN'T EVEN GET
OUT OF HIS HOUSE.

00:23:09.684 --> 00:23:11.183
WHEN IS THIS GONNA
BE ON THE AIR?

00:23:11.185 --> 00:23:15.154
IS THERE ANYTHING YOU'D LIKE
TO SAY TO PEOPLE OUT THERE?

00:23:15.156 --> 00:23:16.355
FOLLOW YOUR DREAMS!

00:23:16.357 --> 00:23:19.992
YOU<i> CAN</i> REACH YOUR GOALS,
I'M LIVING PROOF.

00:23:19.994 --> 00:23:22.361
BEEFCAKE,
BEEFCAKE!

00:23:22.363 --> 00:23:24.797
HE NEEDS TO RUN HIS ASS
AROUND THE BLOCK A FEW TIMES.

00:23:24.799 --> 00:23:28.601
HOW ABOUT A LITTLE MORE
OF THAT GOOD LOVIN', CHEF?

00:23:28.603 --> 00:23:29.435
DAMN, WOMAN!

00:23:29.437 --> 00:23:31.971
I JUST GAVE YOU SWEET LOVIN'
FIVE MINUTES AGO!
